Z||000003||pherder||10-27-2001||06:09 PM||||I thought the second picture was the cat's meow!?!?!?<P>Anywho ... The tubular control arms with 9 way adjustable height adjustable shocks are Ryane Motorsport pieces ... purchased ~ 5 years ago.  The cross-member and the knuckles were powder coated red/silver.  I have brand new front hubs (from GM) to put on and a set of brand new rotors and calipers also from GM to put on to complete the setup.<P>When I went to assemble them I found that the upper control arm steel bushings were the wrong size ... Ryane Motorsports wouldn't return my email ... Held Motorsports wanted ~$46 for the four bushings so I went back to my old friends at RCC and they made me a set.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Paul||||reg||1
